a":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12615","seq":12615,"timestamp":"1788806784Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12615,"endedSeq":12724,"startedAt":"1788806784Z","endedAt":"1788807909Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"images":[],"activityStartSeq":12615,"activityEndSeq":12724,"totalEventCount":13,"toolCallCount":12,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":5,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_07448acec102cece016a9f0ad63ffc87d0a0284aa3cf262dbe","seq":12875,"timestamp":"1788807909Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"3ff50455-e87b-41e5-adff-b6a614ef6e7b","content":"结构化诊断现已正常工作，并定位到真实门禁失败：所有延迟、cold p95 7,178 ms、16 effects、Host RSS、post-GC、queue、OOM 均通过，但 release Relay cgroup 的 `memory.swap.current` 为 **44,527,616 bytes**，runner 在 `performance-resident-measure` 按 `swap == 0` 阻断。先回到验收原文核对“无持续 swap”和“memory+swap 4 GiB”的精确定义，再检查该值是否为运行前遗留、持续增长，或拓扑容量隔离不完整；不会把一次非零快照直接改成通过，也不会放宽阈值。","startedSeq":12725,"endedSeq":12875,"startedAt":"1788807909Z","endedAt":"1788807913Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":25882,"revision":12875,"observedAt":"1788807913Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788801538Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788807913Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":19507,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788801538,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788807913,"revision":12875,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_07448acec102cece016a9f0ad63ffc87d0a0284aa3cf262dbe","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12876","seq":12876,"timestamp":"1788807921Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12876,"endedSeq":12890,"startedAt":"1788807921Z","endedAt":"1788807958Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"images":[],"activityStartSeq":12876,"activityEndSeq":12890,"totalEventCount":3,"toolCallCount":2,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_015b9a9088ecdeea016a9f0af3890c87d09e6b7fd483f0b638","seq":13039,"timestamp":"1788807958Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"3ff50455-e87b-41e5-adff-b6a614ef6e7b","content":"验收合同要求的是“无持续 swap / 无 swap thrashing”，不是“任一时刻 `memory.swap.current` 必须严格为 0”。当前脚本把一个 44.5 MiB resident 快照误当成持续抖动，属于门禁实现过严；但在放宽前必须证明它不是增长中的交换压力。先采集远端整机与现有 JI 服务的 swap 基线和短时间 swap-in/out 变化，确认是否存在持续 I/O；若稳定，则把门禁改成记录每个 JI cgroup 的起止 swap，并仅在固定驻留观察窗内持续增长时失败，同时保留绝对值证据。","startedSeq":12891,"endedSeq":13039,"startedAt":"1788807958Z","endedAt":"1788807960Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":25929,"revision":13039,"observedAt":"1788807960Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788801538Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788807960Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":19507,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788801538,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788807960,"revision":13039,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_015b9a9088ecdeea016a9f0af3890c87d09e6b7fd483f0b638","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13040","seq":13040,"timestamp":"1788807960Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13040,"endedSeq":13055,"startedAt":"1788807960Z","endedAt":"1788808028Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"images":[],"activityStartSeq":13040,"activityEndSeq":13055,"totalEventCount":2,"toolCallCount":1,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0be0c28d02e96283016a9f0b2fd44087d0b23de4b1eb4fc8cd","seq":13168,"timestamp":"17